-- Tests for the California module. Every expected value is read from the source, cited beside it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `labelling-domain`
IMPORT `ca-bpc-22757`
IMPORT `test-kit`

§ `22757.6 and SB 1000 -- which text governs`

#ASSERT         `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `30 September 2026`
#ASSERT         `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT REFUSED `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `29 September 2026`
        BECAUSE "the text of this chapter in force from 2 August to 29 September 2026 (SB 942 as amended by AB 853) is not encoded"
#ASSERT REFUSED `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `2 August 2026`
        BECAUSE "the text of this chapter in force from 2 August to 29 September 2026 (SB 942 as amended by AB 853) is not encoded"
-- 22757.6: not operative before 2 August 2026.
#ASSERT NOT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 August 2026`

§ `22757.1(e) -- covered provider: no user threshold since SB 1000`

#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, with monthly users numbering` 500000) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, with monthly users numbering` 1) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, except that it` `is not accessible in California`) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
-- Washington's exclusions are not California's.
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, except that it` `is used business-to-business`) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
-- "a person" is undefined in the sources encoded: a government provider refuses (fork F15).
-- This assertion expected TRUE until the independent test pass (W-04 to W-06) showed the
-- sources do not answer; see NOTES.md section 6.
#ASSERT REFUSED `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, except that it` `is a government`) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
        BECAUSE "whether a state, local, or tribal government is a \"person\" under 22757.1(e) is not answered by the sources encoded"

§ `22757.3(a) -- image, video, or audio content`

#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `an AI-written article` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the camera capture` `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`

§ `22757.1(l) -- the closed list of minor modifications`

#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `a change to brightness, contrast, or color`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `sharpening`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `saturating`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `resizing`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `scaling`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `cropping`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `file format conversion`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `denoising`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `removal of background noise in audio`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`

-- Off the list, so "altered", however slight: applying a filter and resampling (both on
-- Washington's list), compression, red-eye removal, an object removed.
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the filtered photo` `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `resampling`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` (`a photo an AI system altered by` (LIST `compression`)) `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the photo with red-eye removed` `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the photo with an object removed` `the editor` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`

§ `22757.3(a) -- "To the extent it is technically feasible"`

#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` (`California inputs: feasible` FALSE `, permanent` TRUE `, compatible` TRUE) `1 October 2026`

§ `22757.5 -- exemptions`

#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, except that it` `is a non-user-generated videogame product`) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
-- Washington's "video game or interactive experiences" is a different, wider fact.
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, except that it` `is a video game or interactive experience product`) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
-- (b) applies only "Before January 1, 2029".
#ASSERT NOT `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, except that it` `is assistive technology`) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `31 December 2028`
#ASSERT     `22757.3(a) requires the provider to include a latent disclosure` `the AI-generated image` (`the generator, except that it` `is assistive technology`) `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 January 2029`

§ `22757.3(a)(1) -- the five items`

#ASSERT `the items in 22757.3(a)(1) the disclosure does not convey` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `1 October 2026` EQUALS EMPTY
-- (A): the manifest names the generator, not "OtherCo".
#ASSERT `the items in 22757.3(a)(1) the disclosure does not convey` `the AI-generated image` (`a large consumer provider named` "OtherCo") `1 October 2026` EQUALS (LIST `(A) the name of the covered provider`)
-- No manifest: nothing is conveyed.
#ASSERT `the items in 22757.3(a)(1) the disclosure does not convey` `the AI-generated image, stripped` `the generator` `1 October 2026` EQUALS (LIST `(A) the name of the covered provider`, `(B) the name and version information of the GenAI system`, `(C) the time and date of the content's creation or alteration`, `(D) a unique identifier`, `(E) whether the GenAI system created or altered the content`)
-- (E): "algorithmically enhanced" does not say a GenAI system altered it (fork F8).
#ASSERT `the items in 22757.3(a)(1) the disclosure does not convey` `the photo with red-eye removed` `the editor` `1 October 2026` EQUALS (LIST `(E) whether the GenAI system created or altered the content`)
#ASSERT `the items in 22757.3(a)(1) the disclosure does not convey` `the photo with an object removed` `the editor` `1 October 2026` EQUALS EMPTY
-- (A)-(E) are still answered from 1 January 2029; (F), required from then, is not
-- modelled, so whether the disclosure meets the whole section refuses instead.
-- (Until the independent test pass, C-03 and C-17, the item list itself refused here.)
#ASSERT `the items in 22757.3(a)(1) the disclosure does not convey` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `1 January 2029` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT REFUSED `the content's latent disclosure meets 22757.3(a)` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 January 2029`
        BECAUSE "whether a manifest conveys item (F), whether the GenAI system is designed to primarily function as assistive technology, is not modelled"
-- In the 2 August - 29 September 2026 window the list was different (SB 1000 added (E)).
#ASSERT REFUSED `the items in 22757.3(a)(1) the disclosure does not convey` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `15 September 2026`
        BECAUSE "the text of this chapter in force from 2 August to 29 September 2026 (SB 942 as amended by AB 853) is not encoded"

§ `22757.3(a)(1)-(4) -- the disclosure as a whole`

#ASSERT     `the content's latent disclosure meets 22757.3(a)` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `the content's latent disclosure meets 22757.3(a)` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` `CA: feasible, removable, compatible` `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `the content's latent disclosure meets 22757.3(a)` `the AI-generated image` `the generator` (`California inputs: feasible` TRUE `, permanent` TRUE `, compatible` FALSE) `1 October 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `the content's latent disclosure meets 22757.3(a)` `the AI-generated image, stripped` `the generator` `CA: feasible, permanent, compatible` `1 October 2026`

§ `22757.1(i) and 22757.3.1 -- large online platforms`

-- (c): operative 1 January 2027.
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` `a large social network` `31 December 2026` EQUALS `nothing under 22757.3.1`
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` `a large social network` `1 January 2027` EQUALS (`the interface must make available` TRUE (JUST "babel-fixture-generator") TRUE)
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the camera capture` `a large social network` `1 January 2027` EQUALS (`the interface must make available` TRUE (JUST "c2pa cawg test") TRUE)
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image, stripped` `a large social network` `1 January 2027` EQUALS (`the interface must make available` FALSE NOTHING FALSE)
-- A manifest declaring no source type names no system or device under (ii).
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the colour-adjusted photo` `a large social network` `1 January 2027` EQUALS (`the interface must make available` TRUE NOTHING TRUE)
-- 22757.1(i)(1): "exceeded 2,000,000 unique monthly users".
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` (`a platform where it is a listed kind` TRUE `distributing to others` TRUE `with users` 2000000 `a broadband service` FALSE `a telecom service` FALSE) `1 January 2027` EQUALS `nothing under 22757.3.1`
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` (`a platform where it is a listed kind` TRUE `distributing to others` TRUE `with users` 2000001 `a broadband service` FALSE `a telecom service` FALSE) `1 January 2027` EQUALS (`the interface must make available` TRUE (JUST "babel-fixture-generator") TRUE)
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` (`a platform where it is a listed kind` FALSE `distributing to others` TRUE `with users` 50000000 `a broadband service` FALSE `a telecom service` FALSE) `1 January 2027` EQUALS `nothing under 22757.3.1`
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` (`a platform where it is a listed kind` TRUE `distributing to others` FALSE `with users` 50000000 `a broadband service` FALSE `a telecom service` FALSE) `1 January 2027` EQUALS `nothing under 22757.3.1`
-- 22757.1(i)(2)(A) and (B).
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` (`a platform where it is a listed kind` TRUE `distributing to others` TRUE `with users` 50000000 `a broadband service` TRUE `a telecom service` FALSE) `1 January 2027` EQUALS `nothing under 22757.3.1`
#ASSERT `what the large online platform's interface must make available` `the AI-generated image` (`a platform where it is a listed kind` TRUE `distributing to others` TRUE `with users` 50000000 `a broadband service` FALSE `a telecom service` TRUE) `1 January 2027` EQUALS `nothing under 22757.3.1`
